<!-- App icon foreground (PLAN 148, round 14, pick AI-A): the glossy red ball (old 124C) without its shadow, on the 108 dp adaptive canvas,
     placed as translate(54 54) scale(2.95) translate(-12 -11) so it sits inside the 66 dp safe zone. The group draws the ball in its own
     24 grid; gradients are in that grid. Background = @color/ic_launcher_background (plain #F6F3EC). -->
